@startuml 订单发货顺序图
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 80
skinparam participantBackgroundColor white
skinparam actorBackgroundColor white
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam defaultWidth 400
skinparam sequenceArrowColor Black
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantPadding 40



actor "商家" as Merchant
participant "Orders.vue" as Frontend
participant "OrderController" as Controller
participant "数据库" as Database

Merchant -> Frontend++: 点击"发货",填写物流信息
Frontend -> Controller++: POST /api/orders/:id/ship
Controller -> Database++: 查询订单信息(校验权限和状态)
Database --> Controller--: 返回订单实体
Controller -> Controller: 验证订单为待发货状态
Controller -> Database++: 更新订单状态为已发货,记录物流信息
Database --> Controller--: 返回更新结果
Controller --> Frontend--: 返回发货成功
Frontend --> Merchant--: 显示发货成功提示


@enduml
